(pin "1" (uuid "3eeecaa0-2d19-5393-b61c-bbce85f260d9")))
(text "V11: ten bottom-mounted reverse LEDs shine through PCB into an acrylic plate.\nU2 boost supply uses BAT_SW; one regulated SERIES string, not ten parallel branches.\nR10 = 100 ohm: 204 mV / R10 = 2.04 mA nominal maximum at 100% PWM.\nBL_EN is active-high 20 kHz PWM from existing module P0.31; low shuts down U2.\nRemove LED7..LED10 and bridge EACH removed LED pads 1/2 for six-source mode.\nLED1..LED6 remain distributed across both interior rows; see placement drawing.\nNever bridge R10; do not bypass all LEDs. Power off before rework.\nProtected 1S cell / module charging / RF and optical performance need bench tests." (at 20.32 231.14 0)
(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))
(justify left))
(uuid "2265cc4d-a92c-538d-9186-8c00cfa2fb07"))
(embedded_fonts no))
